CONTRACT goal-gate "THE r > 0 BATTERY -- PRE-REGISTRATION", and nothing else. Paper 16.82 is the derivation; 16.82.4 the two rival hypotheses; 16.82.6 the falsifier.
ARMS  CTL MID GLIDE GLIDE-Z   (GLIDE-Z pre-declared ARM-ABSENT unless the binary echoes RWM_TAIL_BUDGET; armed=0)
AXIS  RWM_DELTA + RWM_COPA_DELTA + RWM_COMPLETION_EXPOSURE, all ABSENT/OFF by default. Nothing here flips a default.
PURGE RWM_THREE_TERM RWM_MIN_R RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS RWM_RACK_CLOCKS RWM_DERIVED_SWEEP RWM_STORE_CAP_UNIFIED RWM_COMPOSED_CAP RWM_ALPHA_OVERRIDE RWM_HOLDDOWN_Q RWM_PLACE_SLACK  (unset at entry, asserted two-sided every rep; RWM_THREE_TERM is the named confound and ships DEFAULT OFF)
WINDOW  --window-reliable, RWM_GEN=0 (plain reliable window), --protocol-hint bulk
